alttools (0.2.1-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Add "Settings" (language, process-list refresh interval) and "About"
    buttons to the main toolbar.
  * Full English/Russian UI localization, switchable from Settings
    (takes effect after a restart, which Settings offers to do).
  * Freeze the process list's periodic refresh while Ctrl is held, so
    Ctrl-clicking to multi-select no longer gets rows reordered out from
    under the pointer.

